          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": [
              "Smart is home to more than 20,000 students and 230,000 alumni with a wide variety of interests, ages and backgrounds, the University reflects the city’s dynamic mix of populations.",
              "Smart offers the kind of education needed for leadership in a rapidly changing world. With an enduring dedication to the pursuit of excellence, University offers unparalleled student experiences across a broad spectrum of academic environments. Explore Smart University’s extensive, world-class online learning opportunities. The most current information about many academic programs of study at the Smart University will be found on the website of the school."
            ]
